  m_Name: Cousin_m3_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - Dialogue: "Listen I got some more cards the other day, and I\u2019ve been itchin
      to try them out."
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - Dialogue: Wanna play a round or two?
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
  Charming_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "Alright! Obviously we can\u2019t play right now, but maybe next
        time."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: I can't wait!
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 49dc780579956e849ae90b220a1124f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "Sure! Just let me know when and I\u2019ll break out the ol cards."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 15
  Assertive_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "Oh yeah? Hey you\u2019re the one who hasn\u2019t played in a while,
        while I\u2019ve been slowly honing my skills all these years."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "I definitely won\u2019t go down as easily as last time."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 49dc780579956e849ae90b220a1124f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "Careful what you wish for, I\u2019ll beat you just like old
      times if I have to."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 10
  Sappy_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "I can teach you if you want. I know you don\u2019t have enough time
        these days,"
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: but it could be something fun to do together.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 49dc780579956e849ae90b220a1124f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "I don\u2019t know. I haven\u2019t played that game in a long
      time."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -5
  Charming_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Right, yeah, of course...
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: Maybe some other time then.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 49dc780579956e849ae90b220a1124f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Well, I am a bit busy lately so I am not sure if I will have
      the time.
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 5
  Assertive_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Oh... I guess so.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: Sorry for asking, that was a stupid question.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 49dc780579956e849ae90b220a1124f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "I\u2019m good, I\u2019m sure I would just destroy you anyways.
      I always did."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -10
  Sappy_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Right, yeah, of course...
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: Maybe some other time then.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 49dc780579956e849ae90b220a1124f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "Maybe some other time, I\u2019ve had a lot on my mind recently."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 5
  Charming_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "Yeah that\u2019s fine, I\u2019ll be sure to catch you up to speed."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "I\u2019m looking forward to it already!"
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 49dc780579956e849ae90b220a1124f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "Sure, you might have to teach me how to play again if that\u2019s
      alright?"
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 15
  Assertive_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "Oh yeah? Hey you\u2019re the one who hasn\u2019t played in a while,
        while I\u2019ve been slowly honing my skills all these years."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "I definitely won\u2019t go down as easily as last time."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 49dc780579956e849ae90b220a1124f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Better question is, are you ready to lose?
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 10
  Sappy_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Oh... I guess so.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: Sorry for asking, that was a stupid question.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 49dc780579956e849ae90b220a1124f8, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "I don\u2019t know, aren\u2019t we getting a bit too old to be
